# Store every file byte for byte, with no line-ending conversion: v2's files mix CRLF (hand-written C#, shaders,
# tools) and LF (Unity's YAML), and checkouts should reproduce them exactly.
* -text

# Binary 3D models go through Git LFS
*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# Look test: baked voxel meshes (big YAML) and its screenshots
